---
import FlowShot from '../FlowShot.astro';
import FlowDetail from '../FlowDetail.astro';
import shotRunCard from '../../../assets/flow/shots/flow-run-card-shot.webp';
import shotEvidenceGallery from '../../../assets/flow/shots/flow-evidence-gallery-shot.webp';
import detailRunCost from '../../../assets/flow/details/detail-run-cost.webp';
import detailRunChecks from '../../../assets/flow/details/detail-run-checks.webp';
import detailRunBinding from '../../../assets/flow/details/detail-run-binding.webp';
---
<section class="border-t border-border/60 px-6 py-14 sm:py-20" aria-labelledby="tour-receipts">
  <div>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl">
      <p class="of-eyebrow" data-animate="rise">Receipts</p>
      <h3 id="tour-receipts" class="of-display scroll-mt-28 mt-4 text-[clamp(1.85rem,3.4vw,2.75rem)]" data-animate="lead">One run. One durable record.</h3>
      <p class="of-lede mt-5" data-animate="rise">Approve a change and Flow records the model, provider, place, cost, checks, evidence, and exact before-and-after content. Your prompt and your API key are not recorded, and there is structurally nowhere in a receipt for them to go.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="of-stage of-stage--pad-top mt-12" data-animate="plate">
      <FlowShot src={shotRunCard} alt="Flow's Receipts timeline beside a demonstration document, with one run card showing checks, evidence, cost, model, route, and content digests." crop sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 78rem, (min-width: 1024px) 64rem, 100vw" />
      <FlowDetail class="of-stage__detail of-stage__detail--tl" src={detailRunCost} alt="A demonstration Flow receipt showing recorded cost, its billing basis, model, provider, and cloud route." caption="Observed cost · Basis, model, provider, and place" sizes="(min-width: 1280px) 30rem, (min-width: 1024px) 27rem, calc(100vw - 3rem)" animate />
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-12 grid max-w-5xl gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold">The check and the rule stay distinct.</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted">A stored outcome says what happened then. A severity pill says what the rule would do now: Stops the change, Warns you, or Needs your acknowledgment. Flow keeps both facts instead of rewriting history when a rule changes.</p>
        <FlowDetail class="mt-6" src={detailRunChecks} alt="Three check rows with stored outcomes and separate current-severity pills." caption="What happened then · What the rule does now" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30rem, calc(100vw - 3rem)" />
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4 class="text-xl font-bold">The receipt is bound to the bytes.</h4>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-text-muted">Before and after fingerprints tie the record to the exact saved document. A validity mark makes that binding checkable later.</p>
        <FlowDetail class="mt-6" src={detailRunBinding} alt="A Flow receipt binding block with before and after content digests and Receipt valid." caption="Before and after digests · Receipt valid" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 30rem, calc(100vw - 3rem)" />
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="mx-auto mt-16 max-w-3xl text-center">
      <p class="of-eyebrow">Evidence</p>
      <h4 class="of-display mt-4 text-[clamp(1.5rem,2.6vw,2.1rem)]">A score must say what it rests on.</h4>
      <p class="of-lede mx-auto mt-4">The Evidence gallery leads with the verdict, then checks, dimensions, coverage, uncertainty, and the recorded reason. A dimension with no measurement says Not scored.</p>
    </div>
    <FlowShot class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-5xl" src={shotEvidenceGallery} alt="Flow's Evidence gallery with a verdict, passed checks, scored dimensions, coverage, uncertainty, and what the score rests on." crop caption="Verdict first · Then the basis" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 64rem, 100vw" />
    <details class="receipts-more mx-auto mt-8 max-w-5xl">
      <summary class="receipts-more__summary">Read the receipt's truth boundaries</summary>
      <ul class="flow-list py-5">
        <li>A score delta appears only after the baseline revision was verified in History, byte for byte. Otherwise Flow shows its reason instead of a number.</li>
        <li>An estimate is never recorded as a charge. A local run records no charge because none was owed.</li>
        <li>The real billed run in the measured facts recorded $0.00425 from 105 input and 149 output tokens, reproducible to the digit.</li>
        <li>When the same model writes and judges a change, the receipt says so.</li>
      </ul>
    </details>
    <p class="of-spec-fine mx-auto mt-8 max-w-3xl text-center uppercase tracking-[0.14em]">Captured 2026-08-19 on the running build. The pictured receipts are staged demonstration material, not real billed charges; the $0.00425 measured run is real.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .receipts-more { border: 1px solid var(--color-border); border-radius: 1rem; padding: 0 1.25rem; }
  .receipts-more__summary { cursor: pointer; list-style: none; padding: 1rem 0; font-weight: 600; color: var(--color-text); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; }
  .receipts-more__summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .receipts-more__summary::after { content: '+'; color: var(--color-primary); font-size: 1.25rem; transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
  .receipts-more[open] .receipts-more__summary::after { transform: rotate(45deg); }
</style>
